{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-44-1","title":"Isaiah 44:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God comforts the church with his promises. 7 The vanity of idols, 9 and folly of idol makers. 21 He exhorts to praise God for his redemption and omnipotency.</p>\n<p>now. 42:23; 48:16-18; 55:3; Ps 81:11-13; Jer 4:7; Lu 13:34; Heb 3:7,8 O Jacob. 41:8; 43:1; Ge 17:7; De 7:6-8; Ps 105:6,42,43; Jer 30:10; 46:27,28 Ro 11:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-2","title":"Isaiah 44:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>that made. 21; 43:1,7,21 formed. 24; 46:3,4; 49:1; Ps 46:5; 71:6; Jer 1:5; Eze 16:4-8; 20:5-12 Heb 4:16 Fear. 41:10,14; 43:1; Lu 12:32; Ro 8:30; Eph 1:4; 1Th 1:4 Jesurun. De 32:15; 33:5 Jeshurun.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-3","title":"Isaiah 44:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>pour water. 41:17; 59:21; Eze 34:26; Joe 3:18; Joh 7:37-39; Re 21:6; 22:17 floods. 32:2; 35:6,7; 43:19,20; 48:21; 49:10; Ps 78:15,16; 107:35 dry ground. Ps 63:1; Mt 12:43 Greek. pour my. 32:15; 59:21; Pr 1:23; Eze 39:29; Joe 2:28; Zec 12:10; Ac 2:17 Ac 2:33,39; 10:45; Tit 3:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-4","title":"Isaiah 44:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>spring. 58:11; 61:11; Ps 1:3; 92:13-15; Ac 2:41-47; 4:4; 5:14 willows. Ps 137:1,2; Eze 17:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-5","title":"Isaiah 44:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>I am. De 26:17-19; Ps 116:16; Jer 50:5; Mic 4:2; Zec 8:20-23; 13:9 subscribe. Ne 9:38; 10:1-29; 2Co 8:5 the name. Ga 6:16; 1Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-6","title":"Isaiah 44:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the King. 33:22; 43:15; Mal 1:14; Mt 25:34; 27:37 his redeemer. 24; 41:14; 43:1,14; 48:17; 54:5; 59:20; Jer 50:34 I am the first. 41:4; 48:12; Re 1:8,11,17,18; 2:8; 22:13 beside. 8; 37:16,20; 42:8; 43:10,11; 45:6,21,22; De 4:35,39; 6:4; 32:39 1Ti 3:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-7","title":"Isaiah 44:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>who. 41:22,26; 43:9,12; 45:21; 46:9,10; 48:3-8 since. 41:4; Ge 17:7,8; De 32:8; Ac 17:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-8","title":"Isaiah 44:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>neither. 2; 41:10-14; Pr 3:25,26; Jer 10:7; 30:10,11; Joh 6:10 have declared. 42:9; 48:5; Ge 15:13-21; 28:13-15; 46:3; 48:19; 49:1-28; Le 26:1-46 De 4:25-31; 28:1-68 ye are. 43:10,12; Ezr 1:2; 8:22; Da 2:28,47; 3:16-28; 4:25; 5:23-30; 6:22 Ac 1:8; 14:15; 17:23-31; Heb 12:1; 1Jo 1:2 Is there. 6; 45:5,6; 46:9; De 4:35,39; 32:39; 1Sa 2:2; 2Sa 22:32; Joh 1:1 Joh 10:30 no God. Heb. no rock. De 32:4,31; Ps 18:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-9","title":"Isaiah 44:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>make. 41:24,29; De 27:15; Ps 97:7; Jer 10:3-8,14,15 and their. 2:20,21; 37:18-20; 46:1,2,6,7; Jud 10:14; 1Ki 18:26-40 Jer 2:11,27,28; 14:22; 16:19,20; Da 5:23; Ho 8:4-6; Hab 2:18-20 1Co 8:4 delectable. Heb. desirable. Da 11:38 their own. 18,20; 42:18; 43:8; 45:20; Ps 115:8; 135:18; Ro 1:22; 2Co 4:4 Eph 4:18; 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-10","title":"Isaiah 44:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>1Ki 12:28; Jer 10:5; Da 3:1,14; Hab 2:18; Ac 19:26; 1Co 8:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-11","title":"Isaiah 44:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>all his. 1:29; 42:17; 45:16; 1Sa 5:3-7; 6:4,5; Ps 97:7; Jer 2:26,27; 10:14 Jer 51:17 let them all. 41:5-7; Jud 6:29-32; 16:23-30; 1Ki 18:19-29,40; Da 3:1-7; 5:1-6 Ac 19:24-34; Re 19:19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-12","title":"Isaiah 44:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>The smith 40:19; 41:6,7; 46:6,7; Ex 32:4,8; Jer 10:3-11 the tongs. or, an axe. yea, he is. Hab 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-13","title":"Isaiah 44:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>he marketh. Ex 20:4,5; De 4:16-18,28; Ac 17:29; Ro 1:23 that it may. Ge 31:19,30,32; 35:2; De 27:15; Jud 17:4,5; 18:24; Eze 8:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-14","title":"Isaiah 44:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>heweth. 40:20; Jer 10:3-8; Ho 4:12; Hab 2:19 strengtheneth. or, taketh courage.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-15","title":"Isaiah 44:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>he maketh a god. 10; 45:20; Jud 2:19; 2Ch 25:14; Re 9:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-17","title":"Isaiah 44:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Deliver me. 36:19,20; 37:38; Da 3:17,29; 6:16,20-22,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-18","title":"Isaiah 44:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>have not. 9,20; 45:20; 46:7,8; Jer 10:8,14; Ro 1:21-23 for he hath. 6:10; 29:10; Ps 81:12; Mt 13:14,15; Ac 14:16; Ro 1:28; 11:8-10 2Co 4:3,4; 2Th 2:9-12 shut. Heb. daubed. cannot. 56:11; Ps 92:6; Pr 2:5-9; 28:5; Jer 5:21; Da 12:10; Ho 14:9 Mt 12:34; Joh 5:44; 8:43; 12:39,40; 2Pe 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-19","title":"Isaiah 44:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>considereth in his heart. Heb. setteth to his heart. 46:8; Ex 7:23; De 32:46; Eze 40:4; Hag 1:5; *marg: Ho 7:2 an abomination. De 27:15; 1Ki 11:5,7; 2Ki 23:13 the stock of a tree. Heb. that which comes of a tree.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-20","title":"Isaiah 44:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>feedeth. Job 15:2; Ps 102:9; Pr 15:14; Ho 12:1; Lu 15:16 a deceived. 1Ki 22:20-23; Job 15:31; Ho 4:12; Ro 1:20-22,28; 2Th 2:11 2Ti 2:13; Re 12:9; 13:14; 18:23; 20:3 Is there. 28:15-17; Jer 16:19; Hab 2:18; 2Th 2:9-11; 1Ti 4:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-21","title":"Isaiah 44:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Remember. 42:23; 46:8,9; De 4:9,23; 31:19-21; 32:18 thou art. 1,2; 41:8,9; 43:1,7,15 thou shalt. 49:15,16; Ro 11:28,29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-22","title":"Isaiah 44:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>blotted. 1:18; 43:25; Ne 4:5; Ps 51:1,9; 103:12; 109:14; Jer 18:23; 33:8 Ac 3:19 as a thick. Job 37:11; La 3:42-44 return. 1:27; 43:1; 48:20; 51:11; 59:20,21; Jer 3:1,12-14; Ho 14:1-4 Lu 1:73,74; Ac 3:18,19; 1Co 6:20; Tit 2:12-14; 1Pe 1:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-23","title":"Isaiah 44:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Sing. 42:10-12; 49:13; 55:12,13; Ps 69:34; 96:11,12; 98:7,8; Jer 51:48 Lu 2:10-14; Re 5:8-14; 12:12; 18:20; 19:1-6 glorified. 26:15; 49:3; 60:21; Eze 36:1,8; 39:13; Eph 1:6,7; 3:21; 2Th 1:10-12 1Pe 4:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-24","title":"Isaiah 44:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>thy redeemer. 6; 43:14; 48:17; 49:7,26; 54:5,8; 59:20; 60:16; 63:16; Ps 78:35 Jer 50:34; Re 5:9 and he. 2; 43:1,7; 46:3,4; 49:1; Job 31:15; Ps 71:6; 139:13-16; Ga 1:15 I am. 40:22; 42:5; 45:12; 48:13; 51:13; Job 9:8; 26:7; Ps 104:2; Jer 51:15 by myself. Joh 1:3; Eph 3:9; Col 1:16,17; Heb 1:2,10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-25","title":"Isaiah 44:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>frustrateth. 47:12-14; 1Ki 22:11,12,22-25,37; 2Ch 18:11,34; Jer 27:9,10 Jer 28:9-17; 50:36 maketh. Ex 9:11; Da 1:20; 2:10-12; 4:7; 5:6-8 turneth. 19:11-14; 29:14; 2Sa 15:31; 16:23; 17:23; Job 5:12-14; Ps 33:10 Jer 49:7; 51:57; 1Co 1:20-27; 3:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-26","title":"Isaiah 44:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>confirmeth. 42:9; Ex 11:4-6; 12:29,30; 1Ki 13:3-5; 18:36-38; Eze 38:17 Zec 1:6; Mt 26:56; Lu 24:44; Ac 2:25-28; 2Pe 1:19-21 that saith. 54:3,11,12; 60:10; Ezr 2:70; Ps 102:13-16; 147:2; Jer 30:18 Jer 31:4,38-40; 33:7; Eze 36:33-36; Da 9:25; Zec 2:4; 12:6 Zec 14:10,11 and I will. 58:12; Ne 1:3; 2:3; 3:1-32; Am 9:14 decayed places. Heb. wastes. 61:4; Eze 36:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-27","title":"Isaiah 44:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Be dry. 11:15,16; 42:15; 43:16; 51:15; Ps 74:15; Jer 50:38; 51:32,36 Re 16:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-44-28","title":"Isaiah 44:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":44,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":44,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Cyrus. 42:15; 45:1,3; 46:11; 48:14,15; Da 10:1 my shepherd. 63:11; Ps 78:71,72 saying. 45:13; 2Ch 36:22,23; Ezr 1:1-3; 6:3-18</p>"}]}